{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>巴拿馬在當地周一傍晚6時20分發生黎克特制6.3級地震，美國地質勘探局錄得6.1級。</p><p></p><p>震央位於巴拿馬西部索納市西南約32公里，震源深度10公里，暫時未有傷亡報告。巴拿馬上周五曾發生7.7級地震。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T00:19:56.432920+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:49.433318+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T00:17:49.433318+00:00","content_hash":"97c177425972c924fad56157987a7d869fe0efe8af91552de12279abfe08d42b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}